rectangle "nyx\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>" <<Boundary-bnl4>> {
  rectangle "nyx-mcp\n<size:16>[Container: Rust binary]</size>" <<Boundary-bnl4LW1jcA==>> {
    rectangle "==Protocol loop\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nNewline-delimited JSON-RPC 2.0 over stdio, no async runtime and no SDK; initialize, ping, tools/list and tools/call. `--dir` (workflows and saved scripts), `--root` (the folder a script's file arguments may name); `--job` is the engine's solve worker." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxmcp.Protocolloop
    rectangle "==Script tools\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nFour tools instead of one per command: `script_run` (a script on the kernel; `params`, `path`, `save_as`, `wait_s`, `allow_destructive`), `script_wait` (continue or cancel a script that is waiting for a job), `script_check` (the static check) and `api` (the guide, the command list, one command). One answer, as text, with the project header." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxmcp.Scripttools
  }

  rectangle "==nyx-script\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library and worker binary]</size>\n\nScripts, a third front-end of the engine: Python-syntax text (*.nys) run by Monty in a worker process; each nyx.<command>(...) is one Engine::call. Limits, no ambient access, the engine's path guard." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsRXhlY3V0YWJsZQ==>> as nyx.nyxscript
  component "==nyx-engine\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>\n\nThe Engine: one project, the mesh built for it, the latest result of each physics, the jobs that produce them, and the binding to a workflow. Every action is a named command with a JSON Schema." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeQ==>> as nyx.nyxengine
}

nyx.nyxscript --> nyx.nyxengine <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "One engine command per script call; the path guard\n<size:16>[Rust API]</size>"
nyx.nyxmcp.Protocolloop --> nyx.nyxengine <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Server instructions text\n<size:16>[declared in spec]</size>"
nyx.nyxmcp.Scripttools --> nyx.nyxengine <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "The one engine the scripts drive, and its project header\n<size:16>[declared in spec]</size>"
